	(text "POWER BOARD - sheets 04 07\nControl-board sheets are in the Automotive_ESS_BMS project (one folder up).\nThe boards meet at J701 (sheet 07, female) = J206 (sheet 02, male), 2 x 15 pin.\nSymbol and footprint libraries are shared with the control project."
